## User Stories

### US-11.1: Create and maintain team records

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** create and maintain team records  
**So that** teams participating in a competition can be tracked  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a team with a valid name and league/season and verify that it appears in the team list.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-11.2: Associate teams with leagues and seasons

**As a** league administrator  
**I want to** associate teams with the appropriate league and season  
**So that** the participants in a competition are clear  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Create a team and verify that its league and season associations are saved.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

### US-11.3: View teams for a season

**As a** data user  
**I want to** view teams for a season  
**So that** I can see which teams are participating  

**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open a season's team list and verify that its participating teams are displayed.  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See the Gherkin scenarios below.

